Package: libgnome-desktop-4-2
Version: @DEB_GNOME-DESKTOP_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-desktop
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-4-1, gsettings-desktop-schemas, iso-codes, libxkbcommon0
Description: Shared GNOME desktop utility library (GTK4) - runtime
 libgnome-desktop-4 provides shared utilities (thumbnails, backgrounds, XKB and
 language info) used by GNOME applications such as nautilus.
